WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:33.265
Once or twenty times?

00:00:33.265 --> 00:01:01.447
The curve levels off

00:01:01.447 --> 00:01:35.915
k₁ changes the contribution from repetition

00:01:35.915 --> 00:02:06.726
The same frequency in forty or four hundred terms

00:02:06.726 --> 00:02:37.920
b controls the length effect

00:02:37.920 --> 00:03:13.633
Two controls—not a quality certificate
